dashboard
=========

this is a very basic program to create a simple montoring dashboard for
services.

backend is written in pure go using only the stdlib.
frontend is contained in index.html.

the frontend fetches data from the backend every so often and renders it in the
ui.

the backend, when fetched, returns a list of services and their status in the
following format:

{
	"services": [
		{
			"name": "service_name",
			"url": "service_url",
			"status": 200
		}
	]
}
